{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o072b","title":"司马师出征淮南","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o072b-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"司马师出征淮南","evidence":["shaodi-e-o072b-q"]},{"id":"huanchen-a-452897d1e2ca15831796","label":"正文","text":"毌丘俭作乱景王出征毓纲纪后事加侍中","evidence":["huanchen-q-5022182bab693d0f9c09"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0038","role":"征讨","evidence":["shaodi-e-o072b-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0048","role":"作乱","evidence":["huanchen-q-5022182bab693d0f9c09"]},{"person":"wendi-p0127","role":"纲纪后事、加侍中","evidence":["huanchen-q-5022182bab693d0f9c09"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":255,"label":"正月〔戊寅〕","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y255","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o072","basis":"正月〔戊寅〕"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o072b-q","shaodi-q-o072","shaodi-q-b-2de9ea37d1e15a7d296f"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o072b-q","source_order":[4,333,"O072b"],"order":1140}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0048","name":"毌丘俭","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0038","name":"司马师","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0127","name":"卢毓","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"huanchen-q-5022182bab693d0f9c09","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-fc95da304b467363eabb","layer":"original","quote":"毌丘俭作乱，大将军司马景王出征，毓纲纪后事〖9〗，加侍中","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":585,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":21,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o072b-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-4b9070779d1c209c6814","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月，乙丑〖6〗，镇东将军毌丘俭、扬州刺史文钦反。（戊戌）〔戊寅〕〖7〗，大将军司马景王征之。癸未〖8〗，车骑将军郭淮薨。闰月，己亥〖9〗，破钦于乐嘉〖10〗；钦遁走，遂奔吴。甲辰〖11〗，安风淮津都尉斩俭〖12〗，传首京都。﹝一﹞壬子〖13〗，复特赦淮南士民诸为俭、钦所诖误者〖14〗。以镇南将军诸葛诞为镇东大将军〖15〗。司马景王薨于许昌。二月，丁巳〖16〗，以卫将军司马文王为大将军〖17〗，录尚书事。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"f